From 20214809fd9b716ca4586dfa1bbe7155955151cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:30:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/18] Add gamepad and touch controls to the game

Input.pollPad feeds pad buttons through the same key codes as the keyboard.
TouchControls adds an on-screen stick, Jump, Pulse and Pause (only on touch devices).
Keyboard, pad and touch movement add together. Removes the 'no gamepad/touch' limitation.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
